data: {"id": "294497cb8ea042f0-thinking-parallel_evidence-971", "run_id": "294497cb8ea042f0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好，我已经阅读了代码预采集的三维可观测性 baseline。现在我来分析这些结果，并制定补证计划。\n\n**已有事实分析：**\n\n1. **Metrics (Prometheus):**\n   - Pod UID: `b134b5a8-7471-4feb-a975-9fbb0cc4f912`\n   - 节点: `node2`\n   - 容器: `app`\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, reason=\"ContainerCreating\" — 确认处于 ContainerCreating 等待状态\n   - `kube_pod_status_phase` Pending = 1, Running = 0 — 确认处于 Pending 阶段\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 — 无重启\n   - 这些指标与 `ContainerCreating` 状态一致\n\n2. **Logging (Elasticsearch):**\n   - coverage", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788428984577, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

