data: {"id": "294497cb8ea042f0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1648", "run_id": "294497cb8ea042f0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "权限受限无法直接查询 CRD 资源，但 kubectl_describe 的事件输出已经明确指向了根因：\n\n**已采集的证据事实：**\n\n1. **Pod 状态**: Pending / ContainerCreating（确认）\n2. **Pod UID**: `b134b5a8-7471-4feb-a975-9fbb0cc4f912`\n3. **节点**: node2 (10.2.0.50)\n4. **容器**: app, image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n5. **注解**: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`\n6. **事件 1**: `Warning NoNetworkFound` — cannot find network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)\n7. **事件 2**: `Warning Failed", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788429002377, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

