导致 kubelet 无法创建 Pod 沙箱，最终使 Pod 无限期卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。\n\n**支撑证据：**\n- **K8s Event (fact-055ac61c33be, fact-0d4c479f81bd)**：重复记录的 `NoNetworkFound` 警告和 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误明确指出了缺失的资源名称和失败的具体位置。\n- **K8s State (fact-0d950d883735)**：状态 `ContainerCreating` 与网络创建失败的机制相符。\n- **Metric (fact-efc905ed1853)**：等待原因 `ContainerCreating` 佐证了上述状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 40.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v: 40.6s (Evidence 33.0s, RCA 7.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 79.085, "metrics": {"run_id": "294497cb8ea042f0", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 79.09278059005737, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "44%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score"